 "format": "Commander",
 "name": "Cosmic Spider-Man: Spider-Verse",
 "notes": [
  "v4, Oct 18, 2026 (High Bracket 2, budget lands): Cosmic Spider-Man (WUBRG 5/5 flying, first strike, trample, lifelink, haste). At the beginning of combat on your turn, every other Spider you control gains all five keywords. 36 creatures, about 29 of them Spiders, so every token and Spider-person swings in as a hasty, lifelinking, trampling flyer.",
  "Plan: ramp turns 1-3 (Sol Ring, Arcane Signet, Farseek, Rampant Growth, Kodama's Reach, Twitching Doll, Guy in the Chair), cast Cosmic turn 4-5, flood the board, swing. Lifelink on the whole team makes racing you nearly impossible.",
  "v2 swaps from v1: out Rhystic Study, Smothering Tithe, Cyclonic Rift (all Game Changers); in Spider-Verse, Origin of Spider-Man, Spider-Suit. Zero Game Changers now.",
  "v3 swaps from v2: out Spider-Man Noir, Lightning Greaves, Spider-Man 2099, Spider-Gwen Free Spirit, Ezekiel Sims, Spider-Man Brooklyn Visionary; in Wall Crawl, Vanquisher's Banner, Guy in the Chair, Spider-Girl Legacy Hero, Skyward Spider, Pictures of Spider-Man. Lowers the curve (four 5-drops out).",
  "v4 swaps from v3 (budget mana base): out Cavern of Souls, Mana Confluence, City of Brass, 5 fetchlands, 3 triomes, 10 shocklands; in Plaza of Heroes (already owned), Gateway Plaza, Rupture Spire, 7 tapped tri-lands, Thornwood Falls, Jungle Hollow, 4 Spider-Man set surveil lands, Island, Swamp, Mountain. Nature's Lore and Three Visits became Rampant Growth and Kodama's Reach because the budget lands have no basic types.",
  "Origin of Spider-Man and Spider-Suit turn non-Spiders (Aunt May, Metallic Mimic, an opponent-stealing target, anything) into Spider Heroes, so they catch Cosmic's keyword buff too.",
  "Bracket 2 guardrails: no Game Changers, no extra turns, no mass land destruction, no two-card infinite combos. Don't add Rhystic Study, Smothering Tithe, Cyclonic Rift, Teferi's Protection, Demonic Tutor, Fierce Guardianship or The Great Henge.",
  "Typal engines: Kindred Discovery, Herald's Horn, Urza's Incubator, Patchwork Banner, Metallic Mimic, Path of Ancestry, Plaza of Heroes, Unclaimed Territory, Secluded Courtyard (all name Spider).",
  "Protection: Spectacular Spider-Man (sac: your creatures get hexproof + indestructible), Heroic Intervention, Strength of Will, Counterspell, Kindred Dominance naming Spider is a one-sided wipe.",
  "Token makers: Spiders-Man, Heroic Horde (two 2/1 reach Spiders if web-slung), Arachnogenesis, Ishkanah, Arasta, Spinneret and Spiderling, Web of Life and Destiny.",
  "Miles Morales, Peter Parker and Gwen Stacy are double-faced and listed by front name (they become Ultimate Spider-Man, Amazing Spider-Man and Ghost-Spider).",
  "Not simulated yet. Picks lean on EDHREC inclusion rates; worth a quick read of each new Spider-Man set card before sleeving.",
  "Optional softening for an easier table: cut Kindred Dominance (one-sided wipe) for Villainous Wrath or another Spider.",
  "Spider-Punk nonbo: its 'spells and abilities can't be countered' applies to everyone, so your Counterspell and Spider-Sense are blank while it's out.",
  "Mana base now has about 18 lands that enter tapped, so expect Cosmic on turn 5 more often than turn 4. Upgrade path, best first: Cavern of Souls, then the shocklands in the doc's swap table."
 ],
